operator: Oooh, what an interesting find!
operator: This looks like a water lily.
operator: I would've expected more of those modified plants down here, but this is just a normal part of the native flora.
operator: And it's also precisely what you'll need to navigate these flooded floors.
operator: If I didn't know better, I'd guess someone placed this here specifically to assist someone like you...
operator: Regardless, these things can grow big enough to support a person's weight even without the Green Arsenal.
operator: With the Green Arsenal, they should be an extremely solid and stalwart platform.
operator: And if planted in soil beneath the water, they'll float straight to the top!
operator: Mighty convenient for exploring your new environs.
operator: In any case, would you like to record any progress in your investigation?
- Yes
	operator: Saving progress...
	[signal arg="save_signal"]
	operator: Save complete.
	jump save_done
- No
	operator: Roger dodger! I'll be here if you need to save progress in the future.
	jump save_done
label save_done
operator: At that, I wish you the best of luck, Gardener.
operator: See you on the flip side!
[signal arg="scene_end_op"]
[end_timeline]